    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3",
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "At the same time, complete the following steps: send data to suppliers and create a claim."
      ],
      "justification": "'At the same time' signals the AND gateway split, while the two listed tasks map directly to the parallel action nodes."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n6",
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the data is sent to suppliers, extract the data from the suppliers and transfer it to the doctor's phone."
      ],
      "justification": "Both extraction and transfer steps are faithfully captured without added qualifiers."
    },
